{"id":"n70747-2-6","stage":0,"title":"동물 · 动物","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70747-2-6-1","ko":"너 혹시 집에서 동물 키우니?","zh":"你家里养宠物吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혹시","meaning":"是不是，是否","explanation":"혹시：是不是，是否","readings":[{"term":"혹시","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87955","senseId":"4","lemma":"혹시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동물","meaning":"动物","explanation":"동물：动物","readings":[{"term":"동물","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70747","senseId":"2","lemma":"동물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"키우니?","meaning":"养","explanation":"키우다：养；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"키우다","audio":"/audio/cff5458b4f7fee672311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66587","senseId":"2","lemma":"키우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"c99406fc3132c80d","term":"혹시","zh":"是不是，是否","audio":"/audio/c99406fc3132c80df65d.mp3","entryId":"87955","definition":"用于对不确定的事情提出疑问，表示虽认为如此，但因不确定而犹豫要不要说。","pronunciation":["혹씨"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"227e25cceb2f8449","term":"동물","zh":"动物","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3","entryId":"70747","definition":"除人类以外的飞禽走兽、游鱼